use these as starting pointers for git commit hooks pls


### Jira



- [] Jira ticket number is added in PR title or description (mandatory)



### Testing



- [] Tested on Android



- [] Tested on iOS



- [] Tested on real device



### Code Quality



- [] Code is formatted



- [] No unused imports



- [] No debug logs in production code



- [] Naming is clear and readable



- [] TypeScript types are added/updated where needed



### UI



- [] No Ul issues across screen sizes



- [] Safe area and keyboard handling verified



- [] Navigation impact reviewed



### Security



- [] No secrets or credentials added



- [] No sensitive data logged